            "content": "<p>I love your new lip glosses! Just ordered 3<br/>more! </p>",
            "author": "Gail M"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_AYaNTD": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Skinny Gray Brow Pencil",
            "subtitle": "Austin, Tx",
            "content": "<p>Love love the gray skinny brow pencil! Also love the Manifest lip gloss!!</p>",
            "author": "Jac R."
          }
        },
        "testimonial_7TfEVr": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Well Done!",
            "subtitle": "Macon, MO",
            "content": "<p>Well Nikol you have done it again. I just received<br/>manifest glow and defiance.  The just beautiful! Thank you!</p>",
